<v Roger Dowds>[游戏节目音乐]

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:46.310
<v Roger Dowds>I feel very strongly that it's Patrick Kavanagh. I think Louis MacNeice died earlier than 1967. So I'll go for Patrick Kavanagh as my final answer.
<v Roger Dowds>我强烈觉得是帕特里克·卡瓦纳。我想路易斯·麦克尼斯去世比1967年更早。所以我选帕特里克·卡瓦纳作为最终答案。

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:47.530
<v Gay Byrne>Final answer?
<v Gay Byrne>最终答案？

