<v Roger Dowds>[笑声]

00:27:11.400 --> 00:27:14.880
<v Roger Dowds>All that was going through my head was that Gay Byrne, himself, had lost a lot of money.
<v Roger Dowds>我脑子里想的只有盖·伯恩本人输了很多钱。

00:27:14.880 --> 00:27:16.310
<v Gay Byrne>Don't start crying on me at this stage.
<v Gay Byrne>别在这阶段跟我哭。

