00:29:25.840 --> 00:29:38.590
<v Ronan Kelly>So what has that future been for Roger? What did he do with the hundreds of thousands? Well, he uses it as an income to supplement part-time work gardening and house minding. It also allows him time to visit elderly people and do messages for them.
<v Ronan Kelly>那么罗杰的未来是什么样的？他用那几十万做了什么？嗯，他用它作为收入来补充园艺和看房的兼职工作。这也让他有时间去拜访老人并为他们跑腿。

