00:29:49.390 --> 00:29:55.120
<v Ronan Kelly>The main thing Roger got from Who Wants to Be a Millionaire wasn't the money. It was self-confidence.
<v Ronan Kelly>罗杰从《谁想成为百万富翁》中得到的最大的东西不是钱。是自信。

