<v Roger Dowds>Well, I think I'm a lot less shy than I was, perhaps. I have more sense of well being within myself. I don't have the awful self-hatred.
<v Roger Dowds>嗯，我想我比以前没那么害羞了，也许。我内心有更多的幸福感。我不再有可怕的自我厌恶。

